WEBVTT

00:00:35.151 --> 00:00:36.781
Th-This can't be happening!

00:00:37.071 --> 00:00:40.791
Groribas was defeated?
He was one of our best warriors!

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:49.251
What manner of creature is he?
And how'd he get aboard?

00:00:49.251 --> 00:00:50.251
Dammit!

00:00:50.251 --> 00:00:53.131
Melzargard was supposed to be guarding the ship!

00:00:53.461 --> 00:00:58.221
Now he and I are the only elite fighters left!

00:00:59.511 --> 00:01:01.471
I bet he's just screwing around…

00:01:01.471 --> 00:01:03.181
I need him now!

00:01:03.181 --> 00:01:03.851
Dammit!

00:01:03.851 --> 00:01:06.141
Geryuganshoop, what is the problem?

00:01:06.441 --> 00:01:09.691
Lord Boros! I-I am terribly sorry.

00:01:10.021 --> 00:01:13.901
One of the natives has
managed to infiltrate the ship.

00:01:13.901 --> 00:01:18.951
In the mere four minutes since coming aboard,
he has damaged 23% of the ship.

00:01:18.951 --> 00:01:20.911
It seems he is alone,

00:01:20.911 --> 00:01:25.461
but he has managed to instantly kill every warrior sent to intercept him.

00:01:25.461 --> 00:01:26.461
Do not panic.

00:01:27.041 --> 00:01:29.711
As long as the power sphere is safe,

00:01:29.711 --> 00:01:31.961
the ship will not go down.

00:01:32.841 --> 00:01:36.971
The damage so far is limited to the crew's living quarters.

00:01:37.301 --> 00:01:40.301
But the lesser warriors won't be enough.

00:01:40.301 --> 00:01:41.511
Geryuganshoop…

00:01:41.511 --> 00:01:45.351
You, Groribas, and Melzargard are my top lieutenants.

00:01:45.351 --> 00:01:46.851
Eliminate this intruder.

00:01:47.481 --> 00:01:51.231
Groribas has fallen, sir…

00:01:52.481 --> 00:01:53.481
What?

00:01:53.481 --> 00:01:56.571
L-Let me get Melzargard back here!

00:01:56.571 --> 00:02:01.531
He and I together will wipe out
the intruder without fail!

00:02:10.501 --> 00:02:15.001
THE DOMINATOR

00:02:10.501 --> 00:02:15.001
OF THE UNIVERSE

00:02:24.351 --> 00:02:28.101
ONE PUNCH

00:02:31.811 --> 00:02:33.561
THREE, TWO, ONE, KILL SHOT

00:02:33.561 --> 00:02:37.321
JOIN THE FIGHT, CERTAIN VICTORY, THE STRONGEST EVER

00:02:33.561 --> 00:02:37.321
SANJOU, HISSHOU, SHIJOU SAIKYOU

00:02:37.321 --> 00:02:39.321
WHAT WAS THAT? FRUSTRATION

00:02:37.321 --> 00:02:39.321
NAN DATTEN DA? FRUSTRATION

00:02:39.321 --> 00:02:40.821
THERE'S NO STOPPING ME

00:02:39.321 --> 00:02:40.821
ORE WA TOMARANAI

00:02:40.821 --> 00:02:44.951
ONE PUNCH, IT'S OVER, VICTORY AFTER VICTORY

00:02:40.821 --> 00:02:44.951
ONE PUNCH, KANRYOU, RENSENRENSHOU

00:02:44.951 --> 00:02:48.581
I WIN, I ALWAYS WIN, OVERWHELMINGLY

00:02:44.951 --> 00:02:48.581
ORE WA KATSU, TSUNE NI KATSU, ASSHOU

00:02:48.581 --> 00:02:52.421
POWER, GET POWER

00:02:52.421 --> 00:02:55.381
RIGHT TO THE VERY LIMIT

00:02:52.421 --> 00:02:55.381
GIRIGIRI GENKAI MADE

00:02:55.381 --> 00:02:56.591
HERO

00:02:56.591 --> 00:02:59.761
PEOPLE SHOWER ME WITH PRAISE

00:02:56.591 --> 00:02:59.761
ORE O TATAERU KOE YA

00:02:59.761 --> 00:03:02.801
BUT I DON'T DO THIS FOR THE FAME

00:02:59.761 --> 00:03:02.801
KASSAI NANTE HOSHIKU WA NAI SA

00:03:02.801 --> 00:03:04.051
HERO

00:03:04.051 --> 00:03:08.811
SO I JUST FIGHT EVIL IN SECRET

00:03:04.051 --> 00:03:08.811
DAKARA HITOSHIREZU AKU TO TATAKAU

00:03:08.811 --> 00:03:10.271
(NOBODY KNOWS WHO HE IS)

00:03:10.271 --> 00:03:14.441
COUNTLESS ENEMIES FILL THE SKY

00:03:10.271 --> 00:03:14.441
SORA OOI OSHIYOSERU TEKI

00:03:14.441 --> 00:03:17.521
BUT I WON'T TURN MY BACK AND FLEE

00:03:14.441 --> 00:03:17.521
ORE WA SE WO MUKE WA SHINAI

00:03:17.521 --> 00:03:18.861
HERO

00:03:18.861 --> 00:03:23.861
I'VE MADE UP MY MIND AND I WON'T GIVE IN

00:03:18.861 --> 00:03:23.861
NARABA YURUGINAKI KAKUGO SHITA TAME

00:03:23.861 --> 00:03:31.081
A FIGHTING HERO

00:03:23.861 --> 00:03:31.081
TATAKAU HERO

00:03:31.081 --> 00:03:37.631
A SOLITARY HERO

00:03:31.081 --> 00:03:37.631
KODOKU NA HERO

00:03:37.631 --> 00:03:42.631
I WANNA BE THE STRONGEST HERO

00:03:37.631 --> 00:03:42.631
I WANNA BE A SAIKYOU HERO

00:03:54.311 --> 00:04:03.321
MYSTERY CRAFT IN SKIES ABOVE CITY A

00:03:54.811 --> 00:04:01.401
We have more information on the enormous flying object that has suddenly appeared

00:04:01.401 --> 00:04:03.321
in the skies over City A.

00:04:04.241 --> 00:04:05.951
I'm here at the scene.

00:04:05.951 --> 00:04:10.241
As you can see, all the main roads
leading to City A have been closed,

00:04:10.621 --> 00:04:12.581
and a state of emergency has been declared.

00:04:14.121 --> 00:04:16.001
According to survivors,

00:04:16.001 --> 00:04:19.461
City A has been almost entirely demolished.

00:04:20.761 --> 00:04:23.421
Name:

00:04:20.761 --> 00:04:23.421
Hammerhe

00:04:20.761 --> 00:04:23.421
Employment Application

00:04:24.931 --> 00:04:32.931
MYSTERY CRAFT IN SKIES ABOVE CITY A

00:04:28.891 --> 00:04:32.931
This image of the giant flying object was captured with a telephoto lens.

00:04:33.431 --> 00:04:35.061
What are your thoughts?

00:04:36.061 --> 00:04:39.571
Most likely, this is the act of an alien or extraterrestrial being.

00:04:40.071 --> 00:04:44.951
Or perhaps it's a life-form from an unknown, highly advanced civilization.

00:04:44.951 --> 00:04:49.241
Of course, other possibilities exist as well.

00:04:49.241 --> 00:04:50.281
I see.

00:04:52.621 --> 00:04:54.331
Also, eyewitnesses report

00:04:54.331 --> 00:04:59.251
seeing very powerful life-forms descending to the ground from the spacecraft.

00:04:59.251 --> 00:05:04.971
Several S-class heroes are presently at ground zero dealing with the situation.

00:05:19.771 --> 00:05:23.281
He pummeled that thing with nothing but his bare fists.

00:05:23.611 --> 00:05:25.571
Truly an S-class hero.

00:05:26.151 --> 00:05:27.281
But even so…

00:05:31.081 --> 00:05:32.991
It's no good!

00:05:32.991 --> 00:05:35.541
It possesses incredible regenerative powers!

00:05:35.541 --> 00:05:39.131
And don't let it hit any part of you!

00:05:39.131 --> 00:05:41.711
A single blow instantly tore my arm off.

00:05:44.211 --> 00:05:46.631
Avoid its attacks at all costs!

00:05:47.431 --> 00:05:49.551
If I may cut in…

00:06:01.061 --> 00:06:04.191
Shall we use a bombardment to finish them off?

00:06:04.191 --> 00:06:05.741
That is good.

00:06:05.741 --> 00:06:07.781
Contact the ship.

00:06:08.241 --> 00:06:09.741
On my way.

00:06:11.451 --> 00:06:13.121
Where do you think you're going?!

00:06:14.491 --> 00:06:15.871
You scum!

00:06:15.871 --> 00:06:18.791
Best mind your manners!

00:06:20.251 --> 00:06:22.631
I hope ya like mincemeat, freak!

00:06:23.381 --> 00:06:26.051
Melzargard! What are you doing?!

00:06:26.051 --> 00:06:27.261
I'm in battle.

00:06:27.261 --> 00:06:28.511
We have an intruder!

00:06:29.051 --> 00:06:30.131
Nonsense.

00:06:30.131 --> 00:06:31.301
It's true.

00:06:31.301 --> 00:06:33.971
Finish them off and get up here right now!

00:06:41.771 --> 00:06:43.481
This one's locked too.

00:06:44.071 --> 00:06:45.651
Hey, open up!

00:06:45.651 --> 00:06:47.151
You've got a visitor!

00:06:49.321 --> 00:06:50.781
Oops… I broke it.

00:06:59.911 --> 00:07:01.081
I've decided.

00:07:01.081 --> 00:07:05.001
I'm going to rip your limbs off,
then keep you as the ship mascot.

00:07:05.001 --> 00:07:06.921
That is good.

00:07:08.511 --> 00:07:11.181
So ya put yourself back together again, eh?

00:07:13.181 --> 00:07:16.011
I'm gonna keep ya for batting practice!

00:07:35.951 --> 00:07:37.121
Comrades!

00:07:37.121 --> 00:07:41.661
It seems that direct physical attacks are ineffective!

00:07:42.041 --> 00:07:47.421
Let's withdraw for now and think of another way
to destroy it, like heat or something!

00:07:47.421 --> 00:07:49.761
Smashing is all I can do!

00:07:49.761 --> 00:07:51.171
Forget it!

00:07:51.631 --> 00:07:54.181
This is all I know, too.

00:07:54.181 --> 00:07:57.181
Can't teach an old dog new tricks.

00:07:57.511 --> 00:08:00.931
Me, too. Sorry, sweet Iaian!

00:08:01.271 --> 00:08:05.061
Iai, don't you have faith in me?

00:08:05.061 --> 00:08:06.941
There's nothing I can't cut down!

00:08:08.611 --> 00:08:09.941
It's pointless…

00:08:10.781 --> 00:08:14.911
These guys are stubborn to a fault.

00:08:19.581 --> 00:08:20.581
Melzargard!

00:08:20.871 --> 00:08:22.711
Look, I really need you on the ship.

00:08:22.711 --> 00:08:25.081
Getting rid of the intruder takes priority.

00:08:25.501 --> 00:08:30.091
I'd love to, but I'm busy.
These creatures are persistent.

00:08:30.421 --> 00:08:31.841
What?!

00:08:31.841 --> 00:08:36.051
The life-forms down there are proving tough to handle too?

00:08:36.051 --> 00:08:38.511
Nothing tough about them.

00:08:38.511 --> 00:08:41.061
What's with the ship? Is it going down?

00:08:42.561 --> 00:08:44.191
It's not going down,

00:08:44.191 --> 00:08:47.311
but more than half the crew have been killed.

00:08:47.311 --> 00:08:48.441
What?!

00:08:51.571 --> 00:08:52.441
Listen.

00:08:52.441 --> 00:08:56.951
Begin cleansing my location with a bombardment from the ship!

00:08:56.951 --> 00:08:59.701
I've got my hands full right now.

00:08:59.701 --> 00:09:03.161
Besides, artillery bombardment is a grunt's job.

00:09:03.161 --> 00:09:06.621
Well, I'm currently unable to return to the ship.

00:09:06.621 --> 00:09:07.671
All right.

00:09:07.671 --> 00:09:10.421
I'll notify the artillery crews.

00:09:10.421 --> 00:09:13.591
Don't get caught up in the barrage and die!

00:09:13.591 --> 00:09:15.341
Hey, wait!

00:09:18.091 --> 00:09:21.061
You should come down here and help me.

00:09:21.061 --> 00:09:22.891
That'd be much faster.

00:09:23.641 --> 00:09:25.981
Hey! Geryuganshoop!

00:09:26.891 --> 00:09:28.101
Damn him.

00:09:28.101 --> 00:09:30.361
How tough is this intruder?

00:09:32.861 --> 00:09:35.821
How 'bout another one?!

00:09:38.321 --> 00:09:40.071
More futile attacks.

00:09:40.071 --> 00:09:43.831
Although you are exhausting yourself. That is good.

00:09:46.461 --> 00:09:47.621
The hell is this?

00:09:52.631 --> 00:09:55.381
A marble? What's this for?

00:09:56.381 --> 00:09:57.881
G-Give it back!

00:09:58.341 --> 00:09:59.641
Sure thing.

00:10:05.061 --> 00:10:05.891
Damn!

00:10:05.891 --> 00:10:08.601
That's gross, ya nasty bastard!

00:10:08.601 --> 00:10:09.731
You dead?

00:10:09.731 --> 00:10:14.571
Hey, this guy's got marble-looking things inside him.

00:10:14.941 --> 00:10:16.321
That's where ya hurt him!

00:10:18.861 --> 00:10:19.861
Oh!

00:10:19.861 --> 00:10:20.821
Nice work.

00:10:21.321 --> 00:10:26.451
So I just have to keep slicing until I hit a vital marble!

00:10:30.961 --> 00:10:32.131
Impossible!

00:10:32.131 --> 00:10:34.881
I'd been growing that head for a hundred years!

00:10:34.881 --> 00:10:36.921
How could it die in a dump like this?

00:10:38.671 --> 00:10:39.631
No matter.

00:10:39.631 --> 00:10:42.221
You scum are all dead when the shells hit.

00:10:42.221 --> 00:10:44.931
They're on their way!

00:10:51.271 --> 00:10:53.111
Attention, intruder!

00:10:53.111 --> 00:10:56.231
Cease your destruction and leave this instant.

00:10:56.231 --> 00:10:57.571
Attention, intruder!

00:10:57.571 --> 00:10:59.031
Leave immediately.

00:10:59.491 --> 00:11:03.621
Otherwise, we will unleash all our forces against you!

00:11:03.621 --> 00:11:04.951
That's weird.

00:11:05.331 --> 00:11:08.121
I hear a voice inside my head.

00:11:08.121 --> 00:11:12.251
Take one more step and you're dead!

00:11:12.251 --> 00:11:16.461
I couldn't get out even if I wanted to!
I've lost my way!

00:11:16.921 --> 00:11:18.511
Really? You'll leave?

00:11:18.511 --> 00:11:20.261
All right, I will guide you.

00:11:21.131 --> 00:11:25.641
Take a right, then go up the stairs there.

00:11:25.641 --> 00:11:26.511
A right?

00:11:27.141 --> 00:11:28.971
Exactly, a right.

00:11:31.061 --> 00:11:33.021
Then I guess I'll go left!

00:11:33.021 --> 00:11:35.021
No, wait! Not that way!

00:11:35.311 --> 00:11:38.611
W-Wait… Hang on! You can't…!

00:11:38.611 --> 00:11:40.781
All right, that was my fault!

00:11:40.781 --> 00:11:44.491
I'll come to you.
Please stay right there.

00:11:44.491 --> 00:11:47.241
Ah! No!

00:11:51.251 --> 00:11:54.041
Now this place looks like a
control room or something.

00:11:54.631 --> 00:11:55.751
You…

00:11:59.211 --> 00:11:59.961
An octopus?

00:12:02.881 --> 00:12:07.851
You dare go around wreaking havoc on our ship?

00:12:08.511 --> 00:12:11.731
Hey! The debris is all flying at me!

00:12:13.771 --> 00:12:18.611
Now I, Geryuganshoop,
the strongest telekinetic in the universe,

00:12:18.611 --> 00:12:20.571
will grind you into paste!

00:12:48.011 --> 00:12:50.851
Just about there.

00:12:50.851 --> 00:12:55.101
Lord Geryuganshoop, preparations for
the bombardment are nearly complete.

00:12:55.101 --> 00:12:56.691
Shall I proceed?

00:12:59.401 --> 00:13:02.821
Maybe he went to the bathroom…

00:13:05.571 --> 00:13:08.071
Hey, Lord Geryuganshoop!

00:13:08.531 --> 00:13:11.581
Telekinetic… Like a psychic?

00:13:12.911 --> 00:13:15.121
You leave me no choice.

00:13:15.121 --> 00:13:16.961
Super Telekinetic Gravitational Wave!

00:13:18.711 --> 00:13:21.461
Die, earthling!

00:13:25.881 --> 00:13:32.511
My unparalleled telekinetic powers allow me
to manipulate even the forces of gravity!

00:13:32.511 --> 00:13:35.931
Have you any idea what a black hole is, you ape?

00:13:35.931 --> 00:13:41.521
Inside one, the gravitational effects are
so strong even light itself cannot esca—

00:13:41.521 --> 00:13:42.361
Wait…

00:13:54.871 --> 00:13:56.161
Now what?

00:13:56.831 --> 00:13:57.711
Take this!

00:13:57.711 --> 00:13:59.041
Telekinetic Rubble Shower!

00:14:08.931 --> 00:14:10.681
I-I got him!

00:14:12.551 --> 00:14:17.481
What a waste of psychic powers.
I mean, you're just tossing pebbles around.

00:14:18.191 --> 00:14:20.101
Anyone can do that.

00:14:21.941 --> 00:14:23.521
H-How… could…

00:14:23.521 --> 00:14:25.691
I… Geryuganshoop…

00:14:25.691 --> 00:14:27.611
be…

00:14:30.701 --> 00:14:31.571
Excuse me.

00:14:33.331 --> 00:14:35.121
Can I ask…

00:14:35.871 --> 00:14:37.541
where your boss is?

00:14:42.751 --> 00:14:44.001
This looks bad.

00:14:50.511 --> 00:14:52.141
Is that confirmed?

00:14:52.141 --> 00:14:59.101
Yes, Child Emperor said that the energy level in the spaceship is rapidly rising.

00:14:59.101 --> 00:15:01.651
But the civilians…

00:15:01.651 --> 00:15:04.361
Recall the search and rescue teams for now.

00:15:04.361 --> 00:15:06.781
Have everyone take cover.

00:15:06.781 --> 00:15:08.651
They could fire at any moment!

00:15:21.041 --> 00:15:22.041
Hop on!

00:15:26.801 --> 00:15:28.591
There we go.

00:15:28.591 --> 00:15:32.511
Lord Geryuganshoop still hasn't
gotten back to me, but whatever.

00:15:32.511 --> 00:15:33.551
Let's see…

00:15:34.511 --> 00:15:40.811
I believe the order was to concentrate fire around the enemies on the surface near Lord Melzargard.

00:15:46.821 --> 00:15:48.441
Two heads to go!

00:15:48.441 --> 00:15:50.071
I'll bust 'em wide open!

00:15:50.071 --> 00:15:51.571
Is it time?

00:15:51.571 --> 00:15:54.071
Ship, bombardment, coming.

00:15:56.661 --> 00:15:58.541
Ah, found ya.

00:15:58.541 --> 00:16:00.291
All right, bombs away!

00:16:05.751 --> 00:16:07.131
It's over.

00:16:07.131 --> 00:16:09.761
Evasion, impossible. Instant death.

00:16:21.271 --> 00:16:23.891
Huh? What happened?

00:16:25.101 --> 00:16:26.361
What on earth?

00:16:26.361 --> 00:16:27.521
They stopped.

00:16:28.651 --> 00:16:31.901
All of you would be dead without me.

00:16:31.901 --> 00:16:34.401
Can't you even finish one small fry?

00:16:34.401 --> 00:16:37.411
Maybe try starting over from Class C.

00:16:43.711 --> 00:16:46.671
You can have your shells back.

00:16:55.681 --> 00:16:57.301
Th-This is…

00:17:05.601 --> 00:17:06.941
I wanna go home.

00:17:12.031 --> 00:17:14.031
I didn’t expect you to be here.

00:17:14.571 --> 00:17:17.241
Thank you, Mumen Rider.

00:17:17.241 --> 00:17:20.031
Which areas are likely to have survivors?

00:17:20.491 --> 00:17:22.491
There must be more out there.

00:17:22.491 --> 00:17:24.291
But you…

00:17:24.291 --> 00:17:26.421
I'll go rescue them right away.

00:17:26.421 --> 00:17:29.421
We want to know, too.

00:17:29.421 --> 00:17:32.051
Yeah, can't let him hog the limelight.

00:17:32.751 --> 00:17:34.801
Stinger, Lightning Max…

00:17:34.801 --> 00:17:37.551
Mind if we borrow this?

00:17:38.141 --> 00:17:39.141
You guys…

00:17:53.691 --> 00:17:54.901
Nice catch.

00:18:04.201 --> 00:18:05.791
Gotcha.

00:18:05.791 --> 00:18:06.331
Smush.

00:18:08.621 --> 00:18:10.211
One left!

00:18:16.421 --> 00:18:17.921
Silverfang!

00:18:18.881 --> 00:18:21.181
A-A direct hit…

00:18:27.891 --> 00:18:29.691
Weak, weak!

00:18:29.691 --> 00:18:32.311
You are all so very weak.

00:18:32.311 --> 00:18:34.021
Dead after a single hit!

00:18:34.821 --> 00:18:37.611
A change of tactics was all I needed.

00:18:37.611 --> 00:18:41.111
If I forget defense and focus on attack,

00:18:41.111 --> 00:18:43.331
this will all be over quickly.

00:18:43.331 --> 00:18:44.951
And you're next!

00:18:47.451 --> 00:18:50.961
I will spring past that sword and squeeze your skull until it pops.

00:18:51.831 --> 00:18:54.921
I'd like to see you try.

00:19:06.521 --> 00:19:07.811
So he's come.

00:19:36.881 --> 00:19:39.551
This planet's finest warrior…

00:19:39.551 --> 00:19:42.511
I sense no limit to his vast power.

00:19:44.261 --> 00:19:46.561
You the boss of these invaders?

00:19:47.391 --> 00:19:48.641
Wonderful!

00:19:50.521 --> 00:19:53.521
Before we fight, let us introduce ourselves.

00:19:56.361 --> 00:20:04.031
I am Boros, leader of the pirate band known as "Dark Matter" and Dominator of the Universe.

00:20:04.451 --> 00:20:06.871
I'm a hero for fu—I mean,

00:20:06.871 --> 00:20:08.621
a professional hero.

00:20:08.621 --> 00:20:09.911
My name's Saitama.

00:20:10.501 --> 00:20:12.041
Saitama…

00:20:12.041 --> 00:20:16.171
Look, I don't know what the
"Denominator of the Universe" wants with Earth,

00:20:16.541 --> 00:20:19.551
but you sure trashed City A.

00:20:20.711 --> 00:20:22.801
What do I want with Earth?

00:20:25.551 --> 00:20:27.181
There exists a prophecy.

00:20:27.511 --> 00:20:28.721
Prophecy?

00:20:28.721 --> 00:20:29.681
You mean…

00:20:30.931 --> 00:20:36.191
I once traveled the universe,
ravaging everything in sight.

00:20:36.651 --> 00:20:39.271
But I was too strong.

00:20:39.271 --> 00:20:43.281
Eventually, there were none left who could face me.

00:20:43.281 --> 00:20:47.201
I came to know the torment of
utter, all-encompassing boredom.

00:20:47.821 --> 00:20:51.621
Then one day, a seer told me…

00:20:51.621 --> 00:20:53.871
On this faraway planet,

00:20:53.871 --> 00:20:58.711
a being exists who is my match,
one who could rekindle my passion for battle.

00:20:59.131 --> 00:21:02.301
That was nearly twenty years ago.

00:21:02.301 --> 00:21:06.131
Have you any idea the distance I have traveled to get here?

00:21:06.721 --> 00:21:13.731
My men thought the prophecy was a ruse,
made up to lure me away.

00:21:13.731 --> 00:21:16.141
But now I am certain.

00:21:16.141 --> 00:21:16.981
Come.

00:21:16.981 --> 00:21:19.861
Give stimulation to my existence.

00:21:19.861 --> 00:21:21.731
That is why I am here!

00:21:26.951 --> 00:21:28.201
Are you stupid?

00:21:28.871 --> 00:21:33.201
You can't go around attacking other planets
just to liven up your boring life.

00:21:33.541 --> 00:21:35.331
Even telemarketers aren't that evil.

00:21:51.721 --> 00:21:56.811
This set of armor, made to seal in my immeasurable, irresistible power,

00:21:56.811 --> 00:21:58.561
has now been broken.

00:21:59.441 --> 00:22:00.561
Okay.

00:22:26.631 --> 00:22:27.921
Let us begin!

00:22:31.641 --> 00:22:37.891
Hey, come back home soon

00:22:31.641 --> 00:22:37.891
nee hayaku kaette kite ne

00:22:45.191 --> 00:22:51.111
When my worries keep me awake under the crescent moon

00:22:45.191 --> 00:22:51.111
tameiki ga mikazuki wo yurasu yoru wa

00:22:51.111 --> 00:22:57.251
All I can do is close my eyes and think of you

00:22:51.111 --> 00:22:57.251
me wo tojite kimi no koto kangaete bakari

00:22:57.251 --> 00:23:00.291
I want to see you, I feel like crying

00:22:57.251 --> 00:23:00.291
aitai kibun nakitai kibun

00:23:00.291 --> 00:23:02.791
I feel so romantic

00:23:00.291 --> 00:23:02.791
romantikku na kibun

00:23:02.791 --> 00:23:09.341
I hope my feelings reach you

00:23:02.791 --> 00:23:09.341
todokete kono omoi

00:23:09.801 --> 00:23:18.101
I know so very well

00:23:09.801 --> 00:23:18.101
datte zutto shitteiru no

00:23:18.101 --> 00:23:23.311
how hard you always work

00:23:18.101 --> 00:23:23.311
ganbatteru koto takusan

00:23:25.021 --> 00:23:27.981
You're the one I love

00:23:25.021 --> 00:23:27.981
daisuki na hito ga

00:23:27.981 --> 00:23:31.111
You're so strong, yet still I worry

00:23:27.981 --> 00:23:31.111
tsuyokute shinpai

00:23:31.111 --> 00:23:37.081
Only I ever see your weakness

00:23:31.111 --> 00:23:37.081
watashi ni dake wa yowasa misete

00:23:37.081 --> 00:23:43.121
I'll find you before the stars

00:23:37.081 --> 00:23:43.121
hoshi yori saki ni mitsukete ageru

00:23:43.121 --> 00:23:48.961
Come right back home

00:23:43.121 --> 00:23:48.961
massugu kaette kite ne

00:23:48.961 --> 00:23:57.181
Hey, come back home soon

00:23:48.961 --> 00:23:57.181
nee hayaku kaette kite ne

00:24:00.021 --> 00:24:20.041
NEXT
TIME

00:24:00.021 --> 00:24:20.041
THE
STRONGEST
HERO

00:24:02.271 --> 00:24:06.061
Next time, on the finale of One Punch Man :

00:24:06.901 --> 00:24:09.111
"The Strongest Hero."

00:24:10.071 --> 00:24:13.451
What does it mean to be "strongest," Saitama?

00:24:14.321 --> 00:24:17.491
You must tell me, too…
